{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">高盛：汤森路透业务与季度数据观察</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">汤森路透<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>财报呈现出一个并不常见的组合：核心业务增长在<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>，利润率指引却因一次性成本和AI投入而显得保守。GS在最新研报中更新公司观点，认为市场对短期扰动的关注可能低估了Big 3业务持续<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>和AI货币化带来的估值空间。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">19.54亿美元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9.5%</span>，高于GS预期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7.3%</span>和FactSet共识的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7.5%</span>。有机收入增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8%</span>，与<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>持平；Big 3业务有机收入增长10%，较一季度的9%进一步提速。管理层将Big 3全年有机增长指引从9.5%上调至9.5%-10%，这是报告中最值得关注的信号之一。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUNnwXZ3bwUSxwWvwKPUwCaq7qr3XxvKbC4ibtjvf5ibS1nG8zJP02yFyV8U3iazKpSm0sDYrSm5B86IVI2OfYOibWboGqoQeRZlTw/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">区域环境与行业变化观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">Legal有机收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10%</span>，高于近期季度的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9%</span>；剔除政府业务后维持<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11%</span>的增速。Westlaw Advantage和CoCounsel Legal的采用继续推动大中小型律所的升级与追加销售。政府业务有机增长从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1%</span><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">回升</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5%</span>，主要受TRSS交易收入带动。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">政府业务约占Legal收入的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">20%</span>，其增速通常为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6%</span>-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8%</span>，低于剔除政府后业务的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11%</span>增速。GS提示，这一尾部效应在3Q不太可能重复，可能导致Legal整体有机增长从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10%</span>回落至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9%</span>左右。但此前因取消和降级造成的困难比较将在三季度末被消化，四季度Legal增长有望获得更有利的基数。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">编辑评论</span>：</strong> 政府业务波动是理解Legal增长节奏的关键变量。二季度<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10%</span>的增速里有一部分来自一次性政府交易收入，剔除后商业客户需求仍稳定在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11%</span>，这更接近业务的真实趋势。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVwPDIbYG1UXGERsGDKnV1yCiaqG7RT6wMGXA0n2tcm0w1LmmCmeZxXicXq0TaJLgibVFo4vFWMC6S2Fa1fetBCHiadAIPzdiaTev1Y/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">AI技术与行业应用观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">Corporates有机收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10%</span>，较<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9%</span><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>，去年影响增长的客户特定因素和交易性逆风已经消退。不确定性、合规和法律专业解决方案需求保持稳健，交易性收入趋势也有所<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">AI组合的客户吸引力在扩大。下一代CoCounsel Legal、OneSource中的AI能力以及CoCounsel Tax &amp; Audit的开发都在推进。管理层明确表示，客户在AI解决方案上的支出主要是增量而非替代性支出，<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">这意味着</span>AI可以在传统内容和流程订阅之外创造新的收入来源。Thomson作为专有的法律领域大模型，在准确性和部署成本上相对横向AI产品形成差异化。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOW1x3dYbmGXibEVm8cl9LibibymMlFibh6YWWwvkgQgZawD52oCVqu3hagaYaiaceF8pRAzfuHmZVW7eYh9HxW9KQTtIa1sFzHZu1bU/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3. Tax业务因市场推广失误节奏变化，利润率短期<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">承压</span></h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">Tax,Audit &amp; Accounting有机增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8%</span>，较<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10%</span>回落。管理层将节奏变化归因于执行问题而非竞争不确定性或客户预算约束：市场推广信息强调长期税务平台愿景，而客户当前仍聚焦于购买单个产品，这削弱了SurePrep等产品在报税季的销售紧迫感，尤其在美国市场。公司预计下半年增长将重新<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>，年底前回到正常运行节奏。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">利润率方面，EBITDA利润率同比扩大30个基点至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">38.1%</span>，略高于GS预测的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">38.0%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOV8qYkCjuoW1NpA1uvSqCP9Q0E4yIaIbYyOJHCtJeibm5VlH7ZxJibc6Vic9dRlo4cFXt4223CbbYpDq3pkBTwcvLnPBwDIjbFRxs/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 55-GS-Thomson Reuters Corp. -TRI.US- Healthy core trends in 2Q tempered by T-A misstep and muted near-term margin outlook-260805</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
